@page "/"

<PageTitle>Dashboard</PageTitle>

<section class="dashboard-hero">
    <div class="hero-content">
        <p class="dashboard-label">Fitness Nutrition Tracker</p>
        <h1>Personal Health Dashboard</h1>
        <p class="dashboard-description">
            Track meals, workouts, personal goals, and progress in one organized place.
            This dashboard connects the main features of the application and provides a clear starting point
            for the final project demonstration.
        </p>

        <div class="dashboard-actions">
            <a class="btn btn-light btn-lg" href="nutrition-diary">Open Nutrition Diary</a>
            <a class="btn btn-outline-light btn-lg" href="workouts">Log Workout</a>
            <a class="btn btn-outline-light btn-lg" href="documentation">View Documentation</a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-panel">
        <div class="hero-panel-card">
            <span class="hero-panel-label">Project Status</span>
            <strong>Ready for Final Review</strong>
            <p>
                Dashboard, nutrition, food registration, workouts, profile, goals, progress,
                and documentation are connected for the W07 completion demo.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="dashboard-stats">
    <div class="stat-card">
        <span class="stat-number">8</span>
        <span class="stat-label">Connected Pages</span>
    </div>

    <div class="stat-card">
        <span class="stat-number">CRUD</span>
        <span class="stat-label">Workout Tracking</span>
    </div>

    <div class="stat-card">
        <span class="stat-number">SQLite</span>
        <span class="stat-label">Nutrition Data</span>
    </div>

    <div class="stat-card">
        <span class="stat-number">Guide</span>
        <span class="stat-label">Documentation</span>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section-heading">
    <p class="dashboard-label">Application Modules</p>
    <h2>Main Features</h2>
    <p>
        Use these sections to demonstrate how the project supports fitness tracking,
        nutrition planning, user profile management, goals, progress review, and user documentation.
    </p>
</section>

<section class="feature-grid">

    <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">🥗</div>
        <h3>Nutrition Diary</h3>
        <p>
            Connects users to the nutrition area, including food tracking, nutrition records,
            and daily nutrition summaries.
        </p>
        <a href="nutrition-diary">Go to Nutrition Diary</a>
    </div>

    <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">🍽️</div>
        <h3>Food Register</h3>
        <p>
            Allows users to register food selections and connect nutrition data to daily tracking.
        </p>
        <a href="register-food">Go to Food Register</a>
    </div>

    <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">🏋️</div>
        <h3>Workouts</h3>
        <p>
            Allows users to add, edit, review, and delete workout records including type,
            duration, date, and notes.
        </p>
        <a href="workouts">Go to Workouts</a>
    </div>

    <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">👤</div>
        <h3>User Profile</h3>
        <p>
            Allows users to save and manage personal information such as name, age,
            height, and starting weight.
        </p>
        <a href="profile">Go to Profile</a>
    </div>

    <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">🎯</div>
        <h3>Goals</h3>
        <p>
            Provides a structured view of personal fitness and nutrition goals for planning
            and future expansion.
        </p>
        <a href="goals">Go to Goals</a>
    </div>

    <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">📈</div>
        <h3>Progress</h3>
        <p>
            Gives users a clear summary area for reviewing meals, workouts, completed goals,
            and overall progress.
        </p>
        <a href="progress">Go to Progress</a>
    </div>

    <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">📘</div>
        <h3>Documentation</h3>
        <p>
            Includes a user guide, final demo flow, known limitations, and future improvements
            for the W07 project completion requirements.
        </p>
        <a href="documentation">Open Documentation</a>
    </div>

    <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">✅</div>
        <h3>Final Demo Ready</h3>
        <p>
            The interface is organized for the final presentation and connects the key pages
            created by the team.
        </p>
        <a href="documentation">View Demo Flow</a>
    </div>

</section>

<section class="feature-card">
    <h3>Recommended Final Presentation Flow</h3>
    <p>
        For the final video, present the application in this order so the demo feels clear and organized.
    </p>

    <ol class="demo-list">
        <li>Start on the Dashboard and explain the purpose of the app.</li>
        <li>Open Profile and save basic user information.</li>
        <li>Open Workouts and add a workout record.</li>
        <li>Edit or delete a workout record to show CRUD functionality.</li>
        <li>Open Nutrition Diary and Food Register to explain nutrition tracking.</li>
        <li>Open Goals and explain planning features.</li>
        <li>Open Progress and explain future progress summaries.</li>
        <li>Finish with Documentation and explain known limitations and next steps.</li>
    </ol>
</section>